      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A male patient who is now 15 years old has experienced a seizure disorder since age 9 years. The seizures were expressed as episodes of excruciating pain localized to the genital region. Appropriate anticonvulsant medication has controlled both pain and seizures."},
